<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="ba2643b9">&lt;p&gt;
    The review board may:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Reject the change
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Request more information related to the change
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Approve the change as requested
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Approve the change subject to specified conditions
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
